```text
Environment variables
        ↓
FastAPI
        ↓
Database connection
```

Example environment variables may eventually include:

```text
DATABASE_HOST
DATABASE_PORT
DATABASE_NAME
DATABASE_USER
DATABASE_PASSWORD
```

Actual secret values must never be committed to GitHub.

